\f0\fs24 \cf0 COMMERCIAL LEASE AGREEMENT\
\
Agreement reference: LSE-CBP-2023-042\
Date of lease:       2023-06-24\
\
BETWEEN:\
  (1) Fenwick Estates Ltd, registered in England and Wales,\
      company number 03318806 ("the Landlord"); and\
  (2) Northgate Supplies Ltd, registered in England and Wales,\
      company number 05512873 ("the Tenant").\
\
1. PREMISES\
   Unit 4, Carrow Business Park, Norwich, comprising approximately\
   1,450 square metres of warehouse and ancillary office space, together\
   with 22 allocated parking spaces.\
\
2. TERM\
   Ten years from 2023-07-01, expiring 2033-06-30, with a tenant-only\
   break option exercisable on 2028-06-30 subject to six months written\
   notice.\
\
3. RENT\
   3.1 Initial rent of GBP 87,000 per annum, exclusive of VAT.\
   3.2 Payable quarterly in advance on the usual quarter days.\
   3.3 Open market rent review on 2028-07-01 and every five years after.\
\
4. SERVICE CHARGE\
   The Tenant shall pay a fair proportion of the costs of maintaining the\
   common parts, currently estimated at GBP 9,400 per annum.\
\
5. REPAIR\
   The Tenant shall keep the premises in good and substantial repair,\
   fair wear and tear excepted, and shall yield up in that condition.\
\
6. INSURANCE\
   The Landlord shall insure the building and recover the premium from\
   the Tenant. The Tenant shall insure its own contents and stock.\
\
7. ALIENATION\
   The Tenant may not assign or underlet the whole or any part without\
   the Landlord's prior written consent, not to be unreasonably withheld.\
\
8. GOVERNING LAW\
   This lease is governed by the laws of England and Wales.\
\
Signed for the Landlord:  H. Fenwick, Director\
Signed for the Tenant:    A. Whitmore, Managing Director\
}